 come solo\n✔ Friendly hosts and a welcoming atmosphere\n✔ Common Groun
 d Challenge to discover shared interests\n✔ Easy board games & socialisi
 ng after the hosted rounds\n✔ Relaxed pub setting\n✔ Friendship-focuse
 d — not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ N
 ew to Toronto or long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone 
